.TH DRAW_TEXTURE_EX 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
draw_texture_ex \- As draw_texture with rotation about dst's center (degrees, clockwise, 0 = as stored) and a Flip (FLIP_NONE, FLIP_H, FLIP_V, or FLIP_H | FLIP_V)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdraw.h\(dq
.BI "void draw_texture_ex(Texture *t, const Rect *src, Rect dst, double angle_degrees, Flip flip);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
As draw_texture with rotation about dst's center (degrees, clockwise, 0 = as stored) and a Flip (FLIP_NONE, FLIP_H, FLIP_V, or FLIP_H | FLIP_V). Rotation is around the destination center, so a rotating sprite stays in place; to rotate about another point, offset dst accordingly.
.SH MODULE
draw (src/engine/draw/draw.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR draw_texture (3),
.BR sprite_draw (3),
.BR Flip (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
